cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "World Risk Poll Data"
abstract: >
  Harmonised respondent-level microdata from the Lloyd's Register
  Foundation World Risk Poll, covering four waves (2019, 2021, 2023 and
  2025). Provided in SPSS (.sav), Apache Parquet and CSV formats, with a
  data dictionary and methodology report for each wave.
authors:
  - name: "Lloyd's Register Foundation"
repository-code: "https://github.com/lrfoundation/world_risk_poll_data"
url: "https://wrp.lrfoundation.org.uk/"
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
version: "2025"
date-released: "2026-09-01"
keywords:
  - world risk poll
  - survey data
  - risk perception
  - safety
  - public opinion
  - Lloyd's Register Foundation
